            The best hand warmer is the one that matches how long you are out in the cold. For most people, that means a reputable rechargeable such as the Zippo HeatBank 9s or the slim OCOOPA UT5 Nano pair for everyday cold, plus a bulk box of HotHands for long days, game days and outages.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
